---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: "help_of(&format!(\"{line} -h\"))"
---
Add objects of one kind to a board; the kind word is the default kind of every --items item.
Without --at each goes to a free corner, in --frame if given, else in the frame a linked object sits in. It prints one line per object with @N and its link.
An image or a file is uploaded first; a link card takes its title from the page. With --items, #N names an earlier item as an arrow end, and one write holds all of them.

USAGE
  holst object add <kind> [flags]

KINDS
  sticker:     Add stickers
  text:        Add texts
  shape:       Add shapes
  frame:       Add frames
  arrow:       Add arrows
  link:        Add links
  image:       Add images
  file:        Add files
  dice:        Add dices
  wheel:       Add wheels
  sticker-stack:Add sticker-stacks
  flipcard:    Add flipcards
  mind-map:    Add mind-maps
  document:    Add documents
  stamp:       Add stamps
  code:        Add codes
  table:       Add tables
  reaction-stamp:Add reaction-stamps
  icon:        Add icons
  task:        Add tasks
  kanban:      Add kanbans
  drawing:     Add drawings

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst o add sticker "Roadmap" "Ask design" -c yellow4
  $ holst o add shape "Roadmap" "Launch" --shape diamond
  $ holst o add frame "Roadmap" "Q4" --items q4.json
  $ holst o add arrow "Roadmap" --from a1b2c3d4 --to e5f6a7b8
  $ holst o add link "Roadmap" https://example.com
  $ holst o add image "Roadmap" mock.png --size 400,300
  $ holst o add dice "Roadmap" --faces 20
  $ holst o add wheel "Roadmap" --choice Pizza --choice Sushi
  $ holst o add sticker-stack "Roadmap" Ideas --size 384,192
  $ holst o add flipcard "Roadmap" Question --back Answer
  $ holst o add mind-map "Roadmap" "Budget" --parent @3 --direction down
  $ holst o add document "Roadmap" "# Spec" --text-format markdown -c blue3
  $ holst o add stamp "Roadmap" "👍" --at 10,20
  $ holst o add code "Roadmap" "$(cat main.rs)" --language rust --theme dark
  $ holst o add table "Roadmap" --rows 3 --columns 4
  $ holst o add reaction-stamp "Roadmap" --on @3 --reaction heart
  $ holst o add icon "Roadmap" rocket-launch --weight bold -c red9
  $ holst o add task "Roadmap" "Ship" --status in-progress --due 2026-11-06
  $ holst o add kanban "Roadmap" --column Now --column Next --swimlane Team
  $ holst o add drawing "Roadmap" --point 10,20 --point 120,80 -c red9

LEARN MORE
  How a board is given: `holst b -h`.
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
